WEBVTT

00:02:57.933 --> 00:03:01.284
I think that the delegates
of the conference actually did listen,

00:03:01.308 --> 00:03:02.576
not just to me,

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:06.743
but to the thousands
of voices calling for change.

00:03:06.767 --> 00:03:10.618
If you look at the declarations,
the documents that came out of Rio,

00:03:10.642 --> 00:03:13.118
they are radical.

00:03:13.142 --> 00:03:16.993
They include the UN's Framework
Convention on Climate Change

00:03:17.017 --> 00:03:18.784
set up to stabilize

00:03:18.808 --> 00:03:21.576
greenhouse gas concentrations
in the atmosphere

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.642
and prevent dangerous interference
with the climate system.

00:03:26.517 --> 00:03:29.826
Twenty-three years
before the Paris Agreement,

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:36.352
154 countries signed this
legally binding international agreement.